class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Zip Code</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:239.4pt; clip:rect(0.5pt,239.15pt,29.1pt,0.25pt);"><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:0.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">It represents in which ‘Zip code’ of the Job </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">location</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:41.36pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:453.07pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="clip:rect(0.5pt,239.15pt,70.5pt,0.25pt);"><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:0.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Skills</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:239.4pt; clip:rect(0.5pt,239.15pt,70.5pt,0.25pt);"><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:0.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">It represents skills of an applicant. It’s an </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">autocomplete text field. We can select </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">multiple skills at a time. It also provides a</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:217.42pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:41.9pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">flexibility to enter new skills if not there in </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">the list.</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:38.02pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:522.56pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="clip:rect(0.5pt,239.15pt,70.5pt,0.25pt);"><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:0.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Immigration status</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:239.4pt; clip:rect(0.5pt,239.15pt,70.5pt,0.25pt);"><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:0.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">It represents immigration status of an </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">applicant required for the job criteria. User </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">can give the required visa types in the field</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:226.8pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:41.9pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">(F-1 Visa, B-1 Visa--). It’s a dropdown </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">field.</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:25.35pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:592.06pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="clip:rect(0.5pt,239.15pt,42.9pt,0.25pt);"><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:0.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Attachment</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:239.4pt; clip:rect(0.5pt,239.15pt,42.9pt,0.25pt);"><div class="awdiv" style="left:5.4pt; top:0.5pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">It represents attachment of a file from </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">window with required details for the Job. It </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:27.99pt; line-height:13.41pt;">allows .pdf, .txt, .xls, .csv, .png, .jpeg, .doc </span></div></div></div