2pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv"><img class="awimg" style="left:1.5pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:257.9pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:454.09pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:255.9pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="343"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,341.7 L624.5,341.7 L-0.5,341.7 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:341.86pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Jobs Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">16</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">We can add applicant through multiple ways:</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:238.13pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">            </span><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt; top:13.8pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:1.66pt; line-height:12pt;"></span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Candidates</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:78.71pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt; top:27.6pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:1.66pt; line-height:12pt;"></span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Add new candidate</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:120.08pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt; top:41.4pt;"><span class="awspan awtext005" style="left:0pt; top:1.66pt; line-height:12pt;"></span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Import candidate</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:107.39pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:55.2pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Submit - Applicant will be added in the list. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:340.79pt;"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Counts</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:41.33pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> – </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:54.67pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Count represents the no. of applicants in each and every stage like shortlist, </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Interview, Offer, etc., </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:629.39pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Score – It represents the value of applicants profile percentage that matched to the job.</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:154.79pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:254.25pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="341"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,339.5 L624.5,339.5 L-0.5,339.5 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:440.39pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:257.9pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="346"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,344.3667 L624.5,344.3667 L-0.5,344.3667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:341.86pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Jobs Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">17</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Source – The one who adds applicant to the Job.</span><div class="awdiv" style="top:13.8pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Applied on – It represents on which date applicant has submitted to the Job. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:41.4pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Shortlist – Shortlist page will be displayed. </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:256.78pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Select the applicants to be shortlisted </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">by checking the checkbox. Shortlist - Applicants will be shortlisted.</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:351.5pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;"> </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:330pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Submit to client – Submission page will be displayed. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:618.59pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Submit to client option will be enabled only for client job. </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:300.84pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Select the applicants to be </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">submitted by checking the checkbox. </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:199.44pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Submit to client – Mail box will be displayed. </span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:141pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:257.3pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="345"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,343.5667 L624.5,343.5667 L-0.5,343.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:429.59pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:258.7pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="347"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,345.4333 L624.5,345.4333 L-0.5,345.4333 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:341.86pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Jobs Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">18</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Send – Applicants will be submitted to the client. </span><div class="awdiv" style="top:290.1pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Schedule interview - Schedule Interview page will be displayed. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt; top:604.79pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">-</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Select the applicants from applicant’s field.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt; top:618.59pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">-</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Enter interview details in respective fields.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt; top:632.39pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">-</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click submit</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:85.8pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:259.55pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="348"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,346.5667 L624.5,346.5667 L-0.5,346.5667 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:389.7pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:255.9pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="343"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,341.7 L624.5,341.7 L-0.5,341.7 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:341.86pt; top:14.13pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Sourcelead – Jobs Module</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:742pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,15pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:0pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">Quick Reference Guide</span><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:456.88pt; top:2.83pt; line-height:11.17pt;">19</span><div class="awdiv" style="left:-1.45pt; top:0pt; width:470.9pt; height:0pt; border-top:solid 1.5pt #000000;"></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:72pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">-</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Selected applicants will be moved to interview stage and count will be shown in </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">respective stage.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt; top:27.6pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">-</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Once interview is scheduled, selected applicants will get an email</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:18pt; top:41.4pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">-</span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">If applicant will not be available at given interview time then applicant can </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:18pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">propose a new time from mail itself. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:346.79pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Generate Offer – Generate offer page will be displayed. </span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:360.59pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Select the applicants from applicants field.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:374.39pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Notify to Applicant – Mail is forwarded to the applicant. Applicant can accept/reject the </span><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:14.19pt; line-height:13.41pt;">offer from mail.</span></div><div class="awdiv" style="top:401.99pt;"><span class="awspan awtext003" style="left:0pt; top:0.39pt; line-height:13.41pt;">Click Submit – Offer will be generated to the selected applicants.</span></div></div><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:154.79pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:1.5pt; top:1.5pt;"><img class="awimg" style="left:0pt; top:0pt; width:468pt; height:260.35pt;" src="data:image/png;base64," /><div class="awdiv" style="left:-0.75pt; top:-0.75pt;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="626" height="349"><defs /><g><g transform="translate(1,1)"><path d="M-0.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,-0.5 L624.5,347.6333 L624.5,347.6333 L-0.5,347.6333 Z" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-miterlimit="13.33333" stroke="#000000" fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd" /></g></g></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="awdiv awpage" style="width:612pt; height:792pt;"><div class="awdiv" style="left:72pt; top:36pt; clip:rect(0pt,540pt,26.3pt,-72pt);"><span class="awspan awtext002" style="font-size:10pt; left:341.8